## Solution
```java[]
class Solution {
    public int minTriangleSum(int[][] triangle) {
        int n = triangle.length;
        int[] dp = new int[n];
        for (int i = 0; i < n; ++i) dp[i] = triangle[n - 1][i];
        for (int i = n - 2; i >= 0; --i) {
            for (int j = 0; j <= i; ++j) {
                dp[j] = triangle[i][j] + Math.min(dp[j], dp[j + 1]);
            }  
        }

        return dp[0];
    }
}
```

